{"metadata":{"alias":[{"Plain":"诱导模"},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"标量扩张"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“标量扩张”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<p>标量扩张在几何上对应丛的拉回.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $f\\colon R \\to S$ 为环同态, 那么 $S$ 可视为 (左 $S$) 右 $R$-模. 对于左 $R$-模 $M$, 定义左 $S$-模\n$$\r\nf_! M = S \\otimes_R M,\r\n$$\n称之为诱导模 (induced module), 或标量扩张 (extension of scalars).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>标量扩张是"},{"Local":{"url":"标量限制","text":"标量限制"}},{"Plain":"的左伴随: 由"},{"Local":{"url":"张量-同态伴随","text":"张量-同态伴随"}},{"Plain":", 对于左 $S$-模 $N$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_S(S\\otimes_R M,N)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,\\operatorname{Hom}_S(S,N)).\r\n$$\n其中 $S$ 视为左 $S$ 右 $R$ 模.</p>\n<p>考虑 $f\\colon R\\to S$ 对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的映射 $\\varphi\\colon \\operatorname{Spec}S\\to\\operatorname{Spec}R$, 则标量扩张对应于"},{"Local":{"url":"六函子","text":"六函子"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"逆像","text":"逆像"}},{"Plain":" $\\varphi^*\\colon \\operatorname{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}S) \\to \\operatorname{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}R)$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"复化","text":"复化"}},{"Plain":"是关于 $\\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{C}$ 的标量扩张.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"张量-同态伴随","text":"张量-同态伴随"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}